title: Tanfana
---
<<if PlayerHasItem("Golden Chalice") and visited("Tanfana")>>
    <<ReturnChalice GameManager>>
	Tanfana: You brought my chalice. You are worthy, mortal. Become my servant, pledge your soul to me, and I shall bestow upon you the power to kill the Hellhound.
	<<jump ChaliceChoice>>
<<elseif PlayerHasItem("Golden Chalice")>>
	Tanfana: I can sense your desperation mortal, and I know what troubles you. The Hellhound... that pest keeps trespassing in my sacred forest! I want it gone, and I think we share that goal. You have my chalice? Impressive, mortal. Become my servant, pledge your soul to me, and I shall bestow upon you the power to kill the Hellhound.
	<<jump ChaliceChoice>>
<<else>>
	Tanfana: I can sense your desperation mortal, and I know what troubles you. The Hellhound... that pest keeps trespassing in my sacred forest! I want it gone, and I think we share that goal. But I cannot help you just yet. I need my chalice. Bring it to me, mortal, and I shall make you my holy champion.
<<endif>>
===

title: ChaliceChoice
---
<<if PlayerGiftItem("Golden Chalice")>><<endif>>
-> Offer your soul
 Tanfana: As expected. Take my blessing, mortal, and rid me of that wretched stray.
 <<TanfanaChoice>>
-> Don't offer your soul
 Tanfana: You dare scorn me, mortal?! Wait until you feel my wrath, you will regret this!
 <<Refused GameManager>>
===